{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026LkXcW6m2om1793630881.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>歐元區製造活動持續擴張。</p><p></p><p>標準普爾全球公布，歐元區製造業採購經理指數10月終值報52.7，高市場預期的52.4，但略低過9月的52.9。指數處於50以上擴張區間，反映歐元區製造業活動擴張。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.683416+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":94,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T14:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T01:59:47.976935+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T15:58:28.833423+00:00","content_hash":"f587e7bf69d6db6920097f0939cbe873bb3500fc343e3b90ed4a8810f31f136d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T16:01:05.683416+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}